  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/51YFy9K.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"776\" height=\"444\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>描述：</strong></span></p>\n<p>這個模組新增了超過200種燈光變化，涵蓋6種類型，其中包含火焰、靈魂火焰以及部分燈光的發光版本。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6UXDAER.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"385\" height=\"769\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>更新日誌：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>v3.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 基座現在支援比較器輸出。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>v3.0</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Cckat5N.png\" width=\"406\" height=\"302\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>v2.2</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 為所有Additional Lights的合成配方新增了配方書解鎖（進度系統）<br>- 新增了一個配置選項，用於啟用/停用火焰/靈魂火焰的合成配方（預設：關閉）<br>&nbsp; （Fabric端：需要Mod Menu和Cloth Config才能更改配置，但模組在沒有它們的情況下也能運作）</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">v2.1</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5jSaxxF.png\" width=\"441\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<p><strong>v2.0</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5UW5kFL.png\" width=\"434\" height=\"332\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>備註：</strong></span></p>\n<p>火坑與立式火炬可以透過右鍵點燃。</p>\n<p>它們也需要2個方塊的空間。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/msZmser.png\" width=\"343\" height=\"224\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OhH1pfG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"190\" height=\"337\"></p>\n<p>你可以使用靈魂法杖將其轉變為靈魂火焰。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cFAJldB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"388\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>特色：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">- 火焰不會造成傷害，沒有火災風險。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">- 靈魂火焰的亮度為10。</span></li>\n<li>- 在潛行模式下放置時，不會點燃。在被破壞前也會拒絕訊號。</li>\n<li>- [1.16] 豬布林會害怕靈魂火焰。（火炬無效）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>截圖：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/V1dXQj4.png\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u3s1aSP.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s262Tie.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xCqX2Sy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IBp8Ktp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GgjVXZy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JIlDVu9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/URf80n1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"465\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GM8W4wF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"465\"></p>\n<p>（以下環境拍攝：材質包：Faithful x32，光影包：BSL v7.1.05p2，地圖：Falcon's Rock v2.0.0）</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>此模組的Faithful x32資源包可在此下載。<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-lights/download/3001273\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-lights/download/3001273</a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>您可以自由將其包含在模組包中。</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
